    'kr.w.p2': `Pick any region for its names in English, Korean script and romanization, its history across six eras, landmarks, food and dialect, and drill down to its counties. The buttons at top left take you back to <b>Silla, Goryeo, Joseon</b> and 1896, and the <b>time guide</b> on the right answers questions.`,
