    'kb.note': `Six battles from the 7th to 16th centuries; the Korean War (1950–1953) is not included. Disputed figures such as troop numbers name their source; the text is checked against the Korean, English and Japanese Wikipedia articles. The two Imjin War sea battles follow the Shared history approach: only what the records of all sides note.`,
